09:49:23 | INFO | 👤 Proxy: I've touched gasoline tons of times at the gas station and pouring it into my mower, and it's ALWAYS way colder than water or oil, every single time, so that's gotta mean something about the liquid itself, not just some evaporation trick.
09:49:30 | INFO | HTTP Request: POST https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions "HTTP/1.1 200 OK"
